      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 4.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Right, hello, good to see you. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.06,
      "end_seconds": 9.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "morning, doctor, sorry about the the rush"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.55,
      "end_seconds": 12.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.11,
      "end_seconds": 21.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "mainly a little breathlessness there's a couple of other things but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.98,
      "end_seconds": 26.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.89,
      "end_seconds": 30.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "It's been four weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.08,
      "end_seconds": 42.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.61,
      "end_seconds": 51.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "it happens all the time i'd give it a six you know out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.91,
      "end_seconds": 56.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "have you been feeling nervous about exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.41,
      "end_seconds": 60.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "yes, for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.95,
      "end_seconds": 63.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.27,
      "end_seconds": 67.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "no not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.95,
      "end_seconds": 69.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.26,
      "end_seconds": 74.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.48,
      "end_seconds": 78.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "And And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.57,
      "end_seconds": 85.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.68,
      "end_seconds": 102.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.53,
      "end_seconds": 108.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.09,
      "end_seconds": 114.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "alright high blood pressure that matches what I have here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.59,
      "end_seconds": 134.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.26,
      "end_seconds": 140.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "I'm on lisinopril 10 milligrams once a day for my pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.16,
      "end_seconds": 143.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "before we go further any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.56,
      "end_seconds": 146.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.91,
      "end_seconds": 151.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "And what about palpitations, leg swelling or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.59,
      "end_seconds": 156.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.1,
      "end_seconds": 159.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.2,
      "end_seconds": 163.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "no that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.85,
      "end_seconds": 169.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.4,
      "end_seconds": 172.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.65,
      "end_seconds": 176.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.42,
      "end_seconds": 189.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.9,
      "end_seconds": 217.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.3,
      "text": "okay: weight 61 kilos, BP is 109 over 80. And SpO2 98 percent on room air, temperature 36.5, height 182 centimetres, BMI works out to 18.4, pulse is 84 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.08,
      "end_seconds": 219.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.76,
      "end_seconds": 224.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.66,
      "end_seconds": 230.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.62,
      "end_seconds": 232.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.56,
      "end_seconds": 234.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.25,
      "end_seconds": 259.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "your heart rate and rhythm are regular and the breastbone wound has healed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.9,
      "end_seconds": 267.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.26,
      "end_seconds": 291.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.37,
      "text": "right here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is recovering well after a heart attack. That's my thinking for now and it may change as we learn more"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.28,
      "end_seconds": 318.53,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "We should do an ECG for post heart attack review. Start the rehabilitation classes and and build up walking gradually. The cardiac rehabilitation team would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.03,
      "end_seconds": 320.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.19,
      "end_seconds": 333.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "I'm not ordering a cholesterol test today. If things carry on in a month, we'll consider it. See me again in three months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.21,
      "end_seconds": 340.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "I can manage that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.73,
      "end_seconds": 346.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.99,
      "end_seconds": 351.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "great thank you for your help"
    },
